"# Documents\n\nEvery program document written so far, exported from Claude Docs on 29 September 2026. Each one is here as Markdown for reading and diffing, and as PDF for the exact layout, including charts. The live, editable versions stay in Claude Docs, and the link beside each document opens it.\n\nCharts and diagrams embedded in a document appear in the Markdown only as a line reading *[Embedded: …]*; the PDF shows them. `_export/manifest.jsonl` records every tab exported: its source id, revision and method.\n\n## Program level (`docs/`)\n\n| Order | Document | What it is | Files | Live |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 0.1 | Creative Industries Course — Curriculum Dissection & Interactive Learning Design | The first analysis of the course material | [md](00-origins/creative-industries-course-dissection/index.md) · [pdf](00-origins/creative-industries-course-dissection/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/VkvyAwHGTw6xCg9DkznQoE) |\n",
"| 0.2 | World-Building Design Curriculum — Instructional Analysis & Build Plan | Instructional analysis and the build plan | [md](00-origins/world-building-curriculum-analysis/index.md) · [pdf](00-origins/world-building-curriculum-analysis/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/DPvEUTSNpsfydJrVvA7zAe) |\n| 0.3 | Program Concept v1 | The first concept for the world-building program | [md](00-origins/program-concept-v1/index.md) · [pdf](00-origins/program-concept-v1/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/Q68Rhtcs9QBxZ5mjnEBjKM) |\n| 0.4 | Program Concept v2 — full depth, two lanes | The concept with Maker and Briefer lanes and three depths | [md](00-origins/program-concept-v2/index.md) · [pdf](00-origins/program-concept-v2/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/8pHK7rKbcjGbfMSfoAYKbk) |\n| 1.1 | Master Structure v2.1 — Pass 1 | Every module and unit, and the artifact schema | [md](01-structure/master-structure-v2.1-pass-1/index.md) · [pdf](01-structure/master-structure-v2.1-pass-1/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/Hcs9iXw32Ym3JDacTPtw4J) |\n",
"| 1.2 | Final Structure v3.0 | Principles, threads, the AI partner, forms, build pipeline | [md](01-structure/final-structure-v3/index.md) · [pdf](01-structure/final-structure-v3/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/3EsC2i7tZcDirWvqEy1KZ1) |\n| 2.1 | Program Hub | Status, decisions and open questions: the one place state changes | [md](02-program/hub/index.md) · [pdf](02-program/hub/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/KbhL2fAxpztfVsCJc4F6tP) |\n| 2.2 | Phase 4 Foundations | Personas, SRC schema, seed worlds, registers, policies | [md](02-program/phase-4-foundations/index.md) · [pdf](02-program/phase-4-foundations/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/JVu5sSAG1FHcG6B1KcXpnc) |\n| 2.3 | Glossary | The program's compendium of terms | [md](02-program/glossary/index.md) · [pdf](02-program/glossary/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/8HprReEvNxePChS1Yb1zg2) |\n| 3.1 | Historian Knowledge Pack (v2) | The first partner-voice pack | [md](03-partner-voices/historian/index.md) · [pdf](03-partner-voices/historian/index.pdf) | [open](https://claude.ai/artifact/SjQRkSQnXuLHrqi6Qn9jTS) |\n\n## Module documents\n\n",
"F1's documents are listed in [`modules/F1-histories-of-making/README.md`](../modules/F1-histories-of-making/README.md).\n"
